          "ContentType": "html",
          "Content": "<div><div><p><span><span>In</span></span><span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><span><span>mid-December</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>2025</span></span><span><span>, the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure SQL:</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></div><ul><li><p><span><span>Identify</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>causes that auto-resume serverless workloads using Activity Log in Azure SQL Database to troubleshoot and<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>optimize</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>access patterns.<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></p></li></ul><p><a href=\"https://aka.ms/AAxxog6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span><span>Learn more</span></span></a><span><span>.&nbsp;</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p><br></div>",
